on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [  4] extcall 80 .............................. <soundBusy(2)>
  [  6] jmpifz [ 17] ............................ if soundBusy(2) then
  [  9] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 11] thebuiltin 86 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 13] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 15] extcall 70 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 17] ret
end
